    ],
    "text": "Winds will be southwesterly. Wind speed will be (30-40) kmph. Wind speed can increase up to (60-65) kmph at times in the sea areas off the coast extending from Mullaittivu to Chilaw via Kankasanthurai, Mannar and from Galle to Pottuvil via Hambantota. Wind speed can increase up to 50 kmph at times in the other sea areas around the island.",
